" The 12-month stock price target is $331.72, which is an increase of 33.76% from the latest price.\n\nPrice Target $331.72 (33.76% upside) Analyst Consensus: Strong Buy\n\n### Amazon plans record 300k holiday hires as the rest of retail pulls back\n\nAmazon plans to hire more than 300,000 people for the holidays, up 20% from last year, and will give seasonal employees who work at least 30 hours a week healthcare from their first day starting Jan.\n\n4 days ago - GeekWire\n\n### Amazon to Hire More Than 300,000 U.S. Workers for Holiday Season\n\nThe company said it is seeking people for seasonal, part-time and full-time roles at its core operations nationwide.\n\n4 days ago - WSJ\n\n### Amazon aims to add 300,000 seasonal workers — and expands health benefits in the new year\n\nAmazon is hiring more seasonal workers than ever this year. The company will also extend healthcare benefits for hourly workers on day one, starting on Jan. 1.\n\n4 days ago - Business Insider\n\n### Amazon plans €16B+ German investment in 2027, including major AWS expansion\n\nAmazon will invest €16B (approx. $18B USD) in Germany in 2027 to expand its cloud services, AI infrastructure, and more. AWS will get €4.8B, which will be focused on the Frankfurt region.\n\n4 days ago - Stock Analysis\n\n### Amazon Pledges Over $17 Billion to Expand German Operations\n\nThe company plans to invest AI infrastructure, high-speed satellite internet, logistics projects and new Prime Video content, the latest big-ticket investment from a U.S. tech company keen to expand o...\n\n4 days ago - WSJ\n\n### Amazon to invest over €16 billion in Germany next year\n\nAmazon plans to invest more than €16 billion (about $18 billion) in ​Germany in 2027, the company said on ‌Tuesday, to expand its cloud computing, AI, satellite internet and media businesses.\n\n4 days ago - Reuters\n\n### 3M expands Amazon data center partnership, shares gain\n\nIndustrial conglomerate 3M said on Monday it was expanding its commercial relationship with Amazon and had ​issued a warrant to an Amazon subsidiary, ‌allowing it the right to buy 3M common stock wort...\n\n5 days ago - Reuters\n\n### Amazon Rallies as Morgan Stanley Sees Major AI Upside | Closing Bell\n\nComprehensive cross-platform coverage of the U.S. market close on Bloomberg Television, Bloomberg Radio, and YouTube with Romaine Bostick, Bailey Lipschultz, Carol Massar and Norah Mulinda. -------- M...\n\n5 days ago - Bloomberg Markets and Finance\n\n### Amazon is taking its biggest shot at Nvidia yet with new TorchNeuron dev tool\n\nOn Monday, Amazon Web Services released a tool called TorchNeuron that lets AI startups easily move their AI apps onto Amazon's AI chip, Trainium. In doing so, Amazon is also taking a direct stab at t...","title":"Amazon.com (AMZN) Stock Price & Overview","url":"https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/amzn/"},{"author":null,"id":"https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/amzn/statistics/","image":"https://stockanalysis.com/stockanalysis-1200x630.png","text":"Amazon.com (AMZN) Statistics & Valuation\n\n248.00 -2.38 (-0.95%) At close: Oct 23, 2026, 4:00 PM EDT\n\n248.80 +0.80 (0.32%) After-hours: Oct 23, 2026, 7:59 PM EDT\n\n## Total Valuation\n\nAmazon has a market cap or net worth of $2.68 trillion. The enterprise value is $2.80 trillion.\n\n| Market Cap | 2.68T |\n| --- | --- |\n| Enterprise Value | 2.80T |\n\n## Important Dates\n\nThe next confirmed earnings date is Thursday, October 29, 2026, after market close.\n\n| Earnings Date | Oct 29, 2026 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Ex-Dividend Date | n/a |\n\n## Share Statistics\n\nAmazon has 10.79 billion shares outstanding. The number of shares has increased by 0.88% in one year.\n\n| Current Share Class | 10.79B |\n| --- | --- |\n| Shares Outstanding | 10.79B |\n| Shares Change (YoY) | +0.88% |\n| Shares Change (QoQ) | +0.27% |\n| Owned by Insiders (%) | 8.94% |\n| Owned by Institutions (%) | 68.18% |\n| Float | 9.81B |\n\n## Valuation Ratios\n\nThe trailing PE ratio is 19.94 and t